    "and pour Your power on us",
    "as we seek more of You",
    "",
    "Pre-Chorus 1:",
    "// I believe in You",
    "and what You'll do in me //",
    "in me...in me",
    "",
    "Chorus 1:",
    "We give You",
    "all, all the glory",
    "We give You",
    "all, all the honor",
    "Amazing Son of God."
